<title>HUNGARY: Eravis says 1996 net profit down.</title>
<headline>Eravis says 1996 net profit down.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996, ending December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of Hungarian forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					 Jan-Dec 1996   Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  228.3     vs    194.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     11.0     vs    242.8</p>
<p>    Net profit			    9.0     vs    200.4</p>
<p>    Net sales revenue	     1,962.4     vs  1,855.1</p>
<p>    Other revenue			88.5     vs    146.8</p>
<p>    Material expenditures	   568.8     vs    537.0</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures	  583.0     vs    602.0</p>
<p>    Depreciation			123.2     vs    163.0</p>
<p>    Other costs			 343.2     vs    277.1</p>
<p>    Other expenditures		204.7     vs    234.3</p>
<p>    Net financial income	    237.5 loss vs    53.3 profit</p>
<p>	 Financial revenue	     73.2     vs     55.5</p>
<p>	 Financial expenditure	310.7     vs	2.2</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	 20.1 profit vs   4.5 loss</p>
<p>	 Extraordinary revenue	512.9     vs	2.2</p>
<p>	 Extraordinary expenditure  492.8     vs	6.7</p>
<p>    Taxation				2.0     vs     42.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Eravis Rt is a hotel company. The 1996 figures are not audited.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
